<title>USA: PHLX to list IDT Corp options on Sept 17.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list IDT Corp options on Sept 17.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said on Thursday it would list options on IDT Corp on September 17.</p>
<p>The options will trade on the March expiration cycle, with initial expirations of October, November, December and March. Opening strikes will be 10, 12-1/2 and 15.</p>
<p>IDT shares ended up 5/8 at 13-3/4 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The PHLX said Susquehanna Investment Group will be the specialist unit for the IDT options.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
